      `weeks of regular benefits paid in the 260 weeks before the beginning of the benefit period` IS A NUMBER
      `the day on which the benefit period was established` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs related provision 2009 c 30 s 4 the section applies to the claimant` IF
        `is a claimant referred to in subsection 55(7) of the Employment Insurance Regulations`
    AND `weeks of regular benefits paid in the 260 weeks before the beginning of the benefit period` LESS THAN 36
    AND `the day on which the benefit period was established` AT LEAST YearMonthDay 2010 6 6
    AND `the day on which the benefit period was established` AT MOST YearMonthDay 2010 7 10

@ref Employment Insurance Regulations, Related Provisions, 2009, c. 30, s. 4 (src:2447-2451)
GIVEN years IS AN `er6 Years of contribution before the benefit period`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Regs related provision 2009 c 30 s 4 the increase in the number of weeks` IS
    BRANCH IF years's `years among the 15 years before in which the claimant contributed at least 30% of the maximum annual employee’s premium` AT LEAST 12 THEN 15   -- (e)
           IF years's `years among the 14 years before in which the claimant contributed at least 30% of the maximum annual employee’s premium` AT LEAST 11 THEN 12   -- (d)
           IF years's `years among the 13 years before in which the claimant contributed at least 30% of the maximum annual employee’s premium` AT LEAST 10 THEN 9   -- (c)
           IF years's `years among the 12 years before in which the claimant contributed at least 30% of the maximum annual employee’s premium` AT LEAST 9 THEN 6   -- (b)
           IF years's `years among the 11 years before in which the claimant contributed at least 30% of the maximum annual employee’s premium` AT LEAST 8 THEN 3   -- (a)
           OTHERWISE 0

@ref Employment Insurance Regulations, Related Provisions, 2009, c. 30, s. 4 (src:2444-2451)
